# Killer's Mask: "When this Equipment enters, manifest dread, then attach this Equipment to that creature." Bot2 Shatters the Mask
# with its enters trigger on the stack. The trigger still manifests dread (ruling 2024-09-20: "You'll still manifest dread even if
# this Equipment isn't on the battlefield"; CR 113.7a): the Lightning Bolt goes face down as a 2/2 and the Guerrilla Gorilla to the
# graveyard, and only the attach does nothing, with no Equipment to attach (CR 701.3b): the 2/2 has no menace.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Killer's Mask
Swamp x6
Guerrilla Gorilla
Lightning Bolt
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Shatter
Mountain x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Killer's Mask.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Shatter.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Killer's Mask)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard = Killer's Mask; Black Lotus
Bot1.Arrange(Lightning Bolt | Guerrilla Gorilla)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield..FaceDownName = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Battlefield..Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield..Keywords = (absent)
Bot1.Graveyard = Guerrilla Gorilla; Killer's Mask; Black Lotus
